<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Untitled Document</title>
    <style>
        @import url('https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Roboto:wght@400;700&display=swap');
        body {
            font-family: 'Roboto', system-ui, sans-serif;
            margin: 0;
            padding: 0;
            background: #f8f9fa;
            display: flex;
            justify-content: center;
            align-items: flex-start;
            min-height: 100vh;
        }
        .document {
            width: 800px;
            max-width: 100%;
            background: #ffffff;
            margin: 40px auto;
            box-shadow: 0 4px 20px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.1);
            border: 1px solid #ddd;
            overflow: hidden;
        }
        .header {
            background: #e3f2fd;
            padding: 15px 20px;
            text-align: center;
            border-bottom: 3px solid #2196f3;
            font-size: 1.4rem;
            font-weight: 700;
            color: #1976d2;
        }
        .content {
            padding: 30px 40px;
            line-height: 1.5;
            font-size: 1.05rem;
        }
        .section-title {
            font-size: 1.3rem;
            font-weight: 700;
            color: #0d47a1;
            margin-bottom: 15px;
            border-bottom: 2px solid #bbdefb;
            padding-bottom: 8px;
        }
        .placeholder {
            width: 100%;
            height: 280px;
            background: #f5f5f5;
            border: 2px dashed #9e9e9e;
            margin: 25px 0;
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            justify-content: center;
            font-size: 1.1rem;
            color: #757575;
            text-align: center;
            position: relative;
            overflow: hidden;
        }
        .placeholder::after {
            content: attr(data-caption);
            font-style: italic;
            color: #9e9e9e;
        }
        table {
            width: 100%;
            border-collapse: collapse;
            margin: 20px 0;
        }
        th, td {
            border: 1px solid #bdbdbd;
            padding: 10px 12px;
            text-align: left;
        }
        th {
            background: #e3f2fd;
            font-weight: 700;
        }
        .math {
            font-family: 'CMU Math', 'STIX Math', serif;
            font-size: 1.3rem;
            line-height: 1.4;
            margin: 15px 0;
        }
        .math-inline {
            background: #f0f4f8;
            padding: 3px 8px;
            border-radius: 4px;
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>
    <div class="document">
        <!-- Header -->
        <div class="header">
            Sample Document Layout
        </div>

        <div class="content">
            <!-- Title -->
            <h1 style="font-size: 2.2rem; text-align: center; margin-bottom: 10px; color: #1a237e;">Document Title</h1>
            <p style="text-align: center; font-style: italic; margin-bottom: 30px;">Subtitle or description</p>

            <!-- Section 1 -->
            <div class="section-title">Main Content Section</div>
            <p>This is the first paragraph of the main body text. It continues with normal flow.</p>
            <p>Additional sentences to demonstrate text wrapping and alignment.</p>

            <!-- Placeholder 1 -->
            <div class="placeholder" data-caption="[Centered Image Placeholder: width 600px, height 280px]">
                [Image: Sample photo or chart here]
            </div>

            <!-- Section 2 -->
            <div class="section-title">Second Section</div>
            <p>Second paragraph with more text. This block spans the full width as shown in the original layout.</p>

            <!-- Two-column layout simulation -->
            <div style="display: flex; gap: 30px; margin: 25px 0;">
                <div style="flex: 1; border-right: 1px solid #ddd; padding-right: 20px;">
                    <div class="section-title" style="font-size: 1.1rem;">Left Column</div>
                    <ul>
                        <li>First bullet point</li>
                        <li>Second bullet point</li>
                        <li>Third bullet point</li>
                    </ul>
                </div>
                <div style="flex: 1;">
                    <div class="section-title" style="font-size: 1.1rem;">Right Column</div>
                    <p>Content in the right column. Text flows naturally below the title.</p>
                </div>
            </div>

            <!-- Math section -->
            <div class="section-title">Mathematical Content</div>
            <p>Here is an inline expression:</p>
            <p class="math-inline">$E = mc^2$</p>

            <p>And a display equation:</p>
            <div class="math">$$\sum_{i=1}^{n} a_i = 42$$</div>

            <!-- Table -->
            <div class="section-title">Data Table</div>
            <table>
                <tr>
                    <th>Header 1</th>
                    <th>Header 2</th>
                </tr>
                <tr>
                    <td>Row 1, Col 1</td>
                    <td>Row 1, Col 2</td>
                </tr>
                <tr>
                    <td>Row 2, Col 1</td>
                    <td>Row 2, Col 2</td>
                </tr>
            </table>

            <!-- Footer placeholder -->
            <div class="placeholder" style="height: 120px;" data-caption="[Footer: Signature or stamp placeholder]">
                [Signature / Stamp area]
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
</body>
</html>
